  "body_html": "<p>We talked about this last week… and the week prior… and the week prior…</p><p>The stock market gets some “news,” goes down a few percent, shaking and rattling everyone out. Then, after despair is at its highest, reverses, and makes a new local high. Every week, I have acted as a counselor, stating: “everything is fine.” The only thing that has occurred is the S&amp;P 500 continuing to consolidate higher, making higher lows and higher highs locally… continuing its construction of a volatility contraction pattern (VCP). </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png\" width=\"1258\" height=\"866\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:866,&quot;width&quot;:1258,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:280753,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/220688482?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2APY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbac37ee1-e5b6-4bbb-aab3-c389e9e086b8_1258x866.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">People panic are in despair at every little pull back. Then the market recovers higher (locally). We have repeated this cycle since mid-August. </figcaption></figure></div><p>I’m not denying that it is exhausting. I wish the stock market would just go and get the next bull leg on and over with. Unfortunately, I do not control the market. Just ride the waves it provides. </p><p><strong>Despite the news…</strong></p><h4>There has been NOTHING alarming in the stock market. </h4><p>I don’t care what the headlines are saying. What the insiders are doing, such as buying or selling shares. Nor do I care, from an investing standpoint, what is happening in the Middle East. America has essentially been in some form of conflict in the Middle East for decades. Its an average week. </p><p>We have not seen a reputable blue chip stock crash. We have not seen the S&amp;P 500 break structure. It has all been local, consolidated, annoying, volatility. </p><h4>The Bull Market Continues. </h4><p>That said, we also do not buy dips, a terrible long term strategy. You will be rewarded by this habit several times. Corroborate the bad habit due to a few wins. Then be crushed when the market does actually reverse into a bear market. We have simply built out our positions, and are waiting for the next leg upwards. </p><p>Now a signal I am watching, is the “Charizard Index” that I built. Don’t let the name fool you, it should really be called the “Popular Pokemon Index.” This index contains 1,000 of the most popular, and liquid (meaning bought and sold often, just like a stock), cards. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4>The hypothesis is this:</h4><ul><li><p>NFT’s in 2021 were all the rage. People thought they were going to retire from digital images. These were bought at high prices, to “retire” or for kid’s futures.</p></li><li><p>NFTs are a RISK ON asset, meaning, they will drop BEFORE the traditional markets do. </p><ul><li><p>NFTs peaked late 2021, ~3 months before the traditional markets did. </p></li></ul></li><li><p>Pokemon are today’s “NFTs,” or, risk on asset. </p><ul><li><p>People are paying absurd prices for Pokemon cards. Thinking they are going to retire from them. Saving the cards as kid’s college funds. Etc. </p></li></ul></li><li><p>When the Pokemon Index breaks its bullish structure, that will be a roughly ~3 month heads-up, that the traditional markets will fall soon after. </p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"256\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:256,&quot;width&quot;:553,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:288000,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/220688482?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BOR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a48b48-3ff9-42a1-afd0-e68f8a34d98b_553x256.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Though these are not normal investors like you and I, they are exhibiting newbie retail investing habits, of buying peaks. No hate or disrespect to these individuals. This is my opinion, having observed and studied market cycles for years now.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Did we really think a digital rock, or picture of a Bored Ape, was going to retire kids? Many did, and that has since turned out to be false. The same applies with these Pokemon cards. It will have cycles, and bubbles, just like any tradeable asset. It is clearly in bubble territory. Many of these individuals think they are early, but they are not. Late stage investors. I can’t tell you how many Bitcoin investors I have met, that bought at $100k+, and truly think they were “early.” Gary Haase was early, when he started collecting Pokemon in 1999, and why has a official Guinness World Record valuation at $10M, estimated to actually be much higher,<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> but many of the newcomers are not millionaires. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UW1N!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5aa7691-d6ae-41fc-9a82-7a5e1623364b_399x501.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UW1N!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5aa7691-d6ae-41fc-9a82-7a5e1623364b_399x501.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UW1N!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5aa7691-d6ae-41fc-9a82-7a5e1623364b_399x501.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UW1N!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5aa7691-d6ae-41fc-9a82-7a5e1623364b_399x501.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UW1N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5aa7691-d6ae-41fc-9a82-7a5e1623364b_399x501.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UW1N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5aa7691-d6ae-41fc-9a82-7a5e1623364b_399x501.jpeg\" width=\"399\" height=\"501\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;